epper, Sprite</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/0T0jdtz.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0T0jdtz.png\" alt=\"0T0jdtz.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Crunchy Cheetos, Puff Cheetos, Flamin’ Hot Crunchy Cheetos, Flamin’ Hot Puff Cheetos</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mNJdY5o.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mNJdY5o.png\" alt=\"mNJdY5o.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>- Cool Ranch Doritos, Funyuns</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/swH3dTO.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/swH3dTO.png\" alt=\"swH3dTO.png\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Q/A</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Q: “What about _______?”</p>\n<p>A: It’s sold out. Come back Thursday.</p>\n<p>Q: “Where do I find _______?”</p>\n<p>A: The same place you find everything else. In raid, or on a trader.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Up Next</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- Up in Smoke Remastered</p>\n<p>- Loose loot locations for the Corner Store, and quests.</p>\n<p>- Crack</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://c.tenor.com/MOmWWXGr1GUAAAAd/tenor.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://c.tenor.com/MOmWWXGr1GUAAAAd/tenor.gif\" alt=\"tenor.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is WTT?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>What is Welcome To Tarkov?</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov (WTT) is a mod for SPT AKI that has been in development for over a year. What started as a small passion project has grown in size to incorporate 10+ core members as well as contributions from other well-known mod authors and friends of WTT alike.</p>\n<p><strong>How does Welcome To Tarkov change the game?</strong></p>\n<p>As a mod, WTT overhauls SPT AKI, touching on almost every vanilla game system, as well as adding completely new systems to the game and its core mechanics. Inspired by open-world hardcore survival projects like STALKER: Anomaly and STALKER: GAMMA, WTT takes SPT’s artificial multiplayer MMO difficulty adders and replaces them with a challenging world economy, loot scarcity rebalancing, a lore friendly quest overhaul, and a map-traveling system built from rewritten portions of the Traveler mod allowing seamless travel between maps. Aside from its changes to the game’s core properties, WTT also adds to the world’s variety of traders, NPC’s, characters, items, and quests:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Over 500 custom bundles adding new weapons, attachments, wearables, containers, food, medical, and barter items.</li>\n<li>New bosses with their own custom gear that will be properly incorporated into WTT’s quest lines.</li>\n<li>New, meaningful traders with their own lore-friendly quests and narrative elements to help the player progress through the story-line of WTT.</li>\n<li>New playable characters and outfits that will add to the player’s customization abilities.</li>\n<li>New quest types incorporating brand new map extraction points, putting the player’s knowledge and familiarization of SPT’s maps to the test.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov stands as one of the largest mods created for SPT AKI thus far.</p>\n<p><strong>When does Welcome To Tarkov release?</strong></p>\n<p><em>Thursday.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Which Thursday?</strong></p>\n<p><em>TBD</em></p>\n<p><strong>Want to follow our progress?</strong></p>\n<p>You can follow the project through it’s development in our discord here:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "0.0.9", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4684, "published_at": "2025-06-01T07:43:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2132/wtt-corner-store/0.0.9", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "0.1.0+beta3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1566, "published_at": "2025-09-25T00:34:40.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2132/wtt-corner-store/0.1.0+beta3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.3", "content_length": 585983186, "downloads": 3532, "published_at": "2025-11-02T06:18:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2132/wtt-corner-store/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.12", "content_length": 578236662, "downloads": 11347, "published_at": "2026-01-01T05:27:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2132/wtt-corner-store/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 2310, "name": "WTT - CommonLib", "slug": "wtt-commonlib", "status": "ok"}]}], "repos": ["LibertadPirate/WTT-CornerStoreRestocked"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/LibertadPirate/WTT-CornerStoreRestocked", "label": "Corner Store 4.0.2 beta2"}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}